  "chapter": {
    "label": "Every screen",
    "heading": "160 screens, edge states included",
    "body": [
      "Every screen on the App page of the Figma file, exported on 26 September 2026 at a 390-pixel phone width and grouped by flow, from sign-in to the animation systems. A frame the file repeats is shown once: Team Battle repeats twenty-one of the duel’s frames, so its tab holds the five that are its own. The sample QR codes and the sign-in email address are pixelated.",
      "The edge states are drawn, not implied: a wrong email code, a friend who can’t cover the stake, an expired challenge link, an empty notification list, a confirmation before deleting the account. The four ticketed modes — Solo Challenge, Tournaments, Today’s Spotlight and Weekly Legend — share one entry: buy a ticket, or, short of balance, watch an ad or deposit. The three timed ones also share one ending, from game over to the final rank."
    ],
    "figureCaption": "Every screen of the app, flow by flow, at phone width; open any screen to see all of it."
  },
